          "name": "Identify language",
          "request": {
            "name": "Identify language",
            "description": {
              "content": "Identifies the language of the input text. Returns a list of suggested languages with confidence levels. The service defaults to returning the top five detected languages, but the number of languages may be lower if the text provides little evidence for particular languages.",
